    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d378-a1">

                <pb facs="0437" n="1171" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1171"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum.</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The Government of Spain will, on or before the fifteenth day of September next,
                    pay to the United States one million five hundred thousand dollars ($1,500,000)
                    in Spanish gold pesos, in full discharge and satisfaction not only of the
                    principal sum agreed to be paid in liquidation of the Mora claim, so called, but
                    of any and every amount that might be claimed to be due as interest on said
                    principal sum.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName>Boston</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1895-08-10">August 10,
                        1895</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Richard Olney</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Secretary of State of the United
                                States</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. Dupuy de Lôme</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Minister from Spain to the United
                                    States</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">J. I. Rodriguez</hi>,<lb/>(<hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Counsel and Attorney in Fact for Mr.
                                    Mora</hi>),</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. D. Shipman</hi>,<lb/>(<hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Of counsel</hi>),<lb/><hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Representing Mora and all Persons Interested
                                    in said Mora Claim</hi>.</item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
